        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B.A.N.K. — Balance? Account? No, Kidding!</strong><br><i>(A cooperative (1-4 players) bank employee simulator with elements of humor and horror)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a new employee at <strong>B.A.N.K.</strong> (<span class=\"bb_strike\">the official acronym is classified</span>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ <strong>Your task</strong> is to serve clients from all corners of the universe. Deposits, loans, currency exchange, document checks — this is now your daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐ To earn money and keep the bank afloat, you must maintain order and uphold <strong>B.A.N.K.'s reputation!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ <strong>B.A.N.K.</strong> is one of the few places offering financial services. But only clients <strong>chosen by the BOSS</strong> can enter. Check documents carefully and get rid of unwanted guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔍 4-Player Co-op: </strong>Make money, and one day you and your friends might just end up<strong> running B.A.N.K.!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👍 Work through <strong>13 shifts</strong> at B.A.N.K. and decide its fate. The game features <strong>4 different endings</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B.A.N.K. — Balance? Account? No, Kidding!</strong><br><i>(A cooperative (1-4 players) bank employee simulator with elements of humor and horror)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a new employee at <strong>B.A.N.K.</strong> (<span class=\"bb_strike\">the official acronym is classified</span>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ <strong>Your task</strong> is to serve clients from all corners of the universe. Deposits, loans, currency exchange, document checks — this is now your daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐ To earn money and keep the bank afloat, you must maintain order and uphold <strong>B.A.N.K.'s reputation!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ <strong>B.A.N.K.</strong> is one of the few places offering financial services. But only clients <strong>chosen by the BOSS</strong> can enter. Check documents carefully and get rid of unwanted guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔍 4-Player Co-op: </strong>Make money, and one day you and your friends might just end up<strong> running B.A.N.K.!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👍 Work through <strong>13 shifts</strong> at B.A.N.K. and decide its fate. The game features <strong>4 different endings</strong>.</p>",
        "short_description": "Congratulations on your new career at B.A.N.K.! Go it alone or with friends (1-4) — serve customers, uphold the bank's reputation, climb the corporate ladder, and find success in your work. It's all up to you!",
